				343,
				1
			],
			"Message": "chore(Output): Add tsconfig.tsbuildinfo to .gitignore\n\nExtend the gitignore to exclude the TypeScript incremental build info file generated by the TypeScript compiler when incremental mode is enabled. This file is a build artifact that should not be tracked in version control.\n\nFollows the pattern established in the previous commit that added Target/ for generated declaration output.",
			"SHA": "c9fc63e7d31001002652dd2662bfa5a606af9f43"
		},
		{
			"Author": "Nikola Hristov",
			"Date": "2026-06-12T15:11:38Z",
			"File": [
				"⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀",
				343,
				2
			],
			"Message": "style(Output): Remove vertical blank lines between consecutive statements\n\nCondense Source/ESBuild/Output.js by removing blank lines between consecutive declarations, config properties, conditional blocks, and plugin entries. The blank-line-per-statement spacing added in the previous format pass created excessive vertical whitespace that reduced information density and made the file harder to scan at a glance.\n\nKey changes:\n- Collapse blank lines between consecutive `let`/`export const`/`export default` declarations\n- Remove blank lines between adjacent object property entries in the config\n- Condense plugin setup callbacks by removing blanks between sequential operations (onStart/onEnd blocks, try-catch chains, Req setup)\n- Trim blank lines around conditional branches and ternary expressions\n\nNo runtime behaviour changes — whitespace only.",
			"SHA": "34c3ffa5218843424213423394f4747b1e28221e"
		},
		{
			"Author": "Nikola Hristov",
			"Date": "2026-06-12T14:39:04Z",
			"File": [
				"⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀",
				344,
				3
			],
			"Message": "style(Output): Format blank-line spacing and emoji spacing\n\nApply two formatting passes across the Output package for consistency with project conventions.\n\nAdd the &#x2001; (em-quad) HTML entity between the Output README heading text\nand the 📦 emoji, matching the spacing convention used across all Element\nREADMEs.\n\nInsert vertical blank lines between top-level declarations in\nSource/ESBuild/Output.js so each exported binding, config property, and the\nplugin array entries are visually separated for readability. No runtime\nbehaviour changes.\n\nReformat the ternary return in the Product Identity plugin to put each branch\non its own line, improving readability without altering logic.",
			"SHA": "078054ab65de63f61ad2047f9740fdb795169113"
